  "id": "USN-8979-1",
  "summary": "deluge vulnerabilities",
  "details": "It was discovered that the web UI in Deluge did not protect against cross-\nsite request forgery. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to\ntrick a user into installing a malicious plugin, resulting in the execution\nof arbitrary code. (CVE-2017-7178)\n\nIt was discovered that the web UI in Deluge incorrectly handled certain\nrequests. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to read arbitrary\nfiles. (CVE-2017-9031)",
